// `overlap-rerank` — deterministic teaching adapter for the Tier-2
// rerank-adapter contract.
//
// Composes `wild:rerank-adapter/rerank-adapter-plugin@0.1.0` verbatim —
// the same world the shipping `llama-rerank` adapter builds on. The
// include inherits:
//
//   - `wild:plugin-meta/plugin-base@0.3.0` — the meta lifecycle
//     (`manifest` / `init` / `shutdown`) every Tier-2 plugin exports.
//   - `import wild:secrets/store@0.1.0` and
//     `import wild:http/outbound@0.1.0` — the typical rerank-adapter
//     imports (api-key + the governed egress call). This sample calls
//     NEITHER (no network, no secrets); wit-bindgen tree-shakes
//     uncalled imports out of the built component, so the binary
//     imports nothing.
//   - `export rerank` — `info()` (the capability profile) and the
//     single one-shot `rerank()` call. Rerank has no streaming sibling.
package wildstuff:overlap-rerank@0.1.0;

world overlap-rerank {
    include wild:rerank-adapter/rerank-adapter-plugin@0.1.0;
}
